{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神茜大.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "NORMAL" "FALSE" "100" "50"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神茜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\中央公園内部夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">tried to protect us right up to the very end. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">At least, </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="7"> tw― </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Ugh!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬鉈.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was rushed to the hospital, but she died in the ambulance before it arrived.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s whereabouts were apparently unknown.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s nata and red robes were apparently thought to have been taken from </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\駅ホーム.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\元木駅.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Senpai, are you both really going away...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, can't be helped, right? After what our parents did, it's hard to stay in this town. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Besides, there's no home or family left for us here anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'll come back. My grandma's house is an hour away by train, so we can see each other anytime."<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh! Looks like my train's here."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\春花電車見送り.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"See you! Let's meet again!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah! See you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! I seriously love you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">But I never heard from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No matter how many times I reached out.</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even after waiting a week.</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even after waiting a month.</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even after waiting a year...</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">―2 years later　Shiyo 802, April 8</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">With the third-year memorial service for </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> behind me, I was riding a train.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I looked into all sorts of things. About the Niimura family... And you're still going. To that Arata settlement... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Senpai<STYLE ID="3">, how is it? Do you sense any danger?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm not sure... I can't really tell..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Now I'm going to the Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... the real witch... and the shinigami. I'm going to meet them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The incident 2 years ago was only the tip of the iceberg.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The incident still isn't over.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The reason I never got in touch with </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="2"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">was to forge my weak self into something stronger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Everyone who gets involved with me ends up unhappy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That's why I've spent 2 years in the mountain seclusion.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Soon it'll be 2 years since I left Motoki-cho―</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "3000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
